# NIL Design System

**Canonical sources:**
- Laws: `.cursor/rules/00-nil-design-language.mdc`
- Tokens: `frontend/src/lib/styles/tokens.css`
- Motion: `frontend/src/lib/styles/motion.css`
- IA: `FRAMEWORK.md`

Do not invent colors. `--color-violet*` do not exist — those historical primitives are
retired. A brand accent (`--brand-ember-*`) exists but is scoped to Zone A identity
moments only (cold open, lock screen, session handoff, report cover) — see
`00-nil-design-language.mdc` Law 1. Everywhere else, color means risk:
`--sev-critical` … `--sev-info` only.

Type: `--font-ui` (Inter) for NIL voice; `--font-machine` (JetBrains Mono) for machine output.

GPU zones: see `.cursor/rules/40-nil-gpu.mdc`.
